 if tmp_ans2 > ans:\n            ans = tmp_ans2\n\nprint(ans)\n</repaired_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.152555099310121e-07, -5.23315102327615e-05, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, -0.00018630675913300365, -0.000125281119835563, -3.099436753473128e-06, -3.540453326422721e-05, -4.5536911784438416e-05, 0.0, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -6.318072337307967e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -1.0609570381348021e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -7.748573807475623e-06, -5.245195097813848e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -7.986990567587782e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -3.099436753473128e-06, -2.50339189733495e-06, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -7.986990567587782e-06, -0.08310133963823318, -0.006563534028828144, -0.0021852203644812107, 0.0, 0.0, -2.729855441430118e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -1.8954096958623268e-05, -5.602820692729438e-06, -0.005584472790360451, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -3.707340147229843e-05, -1.9430925021879375e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.487341256113723e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -7.986990567587782e-06, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.622600959512056e-06, -4.291525328881107e-06, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.00026246439665555954, -5.245195097813848e-06, -0.1628868281841278, -0.056081220507621765, -0.001069450518116355, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.168244216387393e-05, 0.0, -4.589452510117553e-05, -1.0132738680113107e-05, -4.6967357775429264e-05, 0.0, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, -3.814689989667386e-06, -4.291525328881107e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -0.0004318020073696971, -4.88756904